/Author (Daniel T. Murphy) /CreationDate (D:20260724033231-04'00') /Creator (\(unspecified\)) /Keywords () /ModDate (D:20260724033231-04'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2088_ROUND_213_CP2_PENTAD_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 213 CP2 Pentad Discovery + New F_TRZ\262 + N_CH\267F_TRZ\263 Additive Multi-Power Form + New F_TRZ + LANDMARK\267F_TRZ\262 Higgs Alternative Composition + New D_BSFG\267\(A_5+1\) Successor Form + New SO_5\267D_crit + magic_28 Additive with Nuclear Magic Number + Domain-Extension of PAPER_1539 \(Backbone-First 72nd Consecutive, 10th CP2 Round MILESTONE\): \(1\) spindle_persistence\(ORB_ANALYSIS_26_PARAMS observed spindle orb persistence across frames\) = 80% = 2 \327 D_phys \327 SO_5 = 4 \327 20 EXACT DOMAIN-EXTENSION of PAPER_1539 blood-pressure-diastolic identity into Persistence-Percent Dimensional Domain; \(2\) energy_per_frame\(ORB_ANALYSIS_18/19/20/23/26_PARAMS observed reactor energy per frame across multiple batches\) = 0.019 J = F_TRZ\262 + N_CH \327 F_TRZ\263 = 0.01 + 9 \327 0.001 EXACT NEW additive F_TRZ multi-power form using N_CH=9 coefficient of F_TRZ\263 term at Energy-Joule domain; \(3\) lambda_Higgs_alt\(ORB_ANALYSIS_44_PARAMS observed Higgs self-coupling\) = 0.13 = F_TRZ + \(D_phys-1\) \327 F_TRZ\262 = 0.1 + 0.03 EXACT NEW alternative F_TRZ + LANDMARK\267F_TRZ\262 composed additive form for Higgs self-coupling complementing PAPER_1842 SSq/\(K_MEX\267\(2+F_TRZ\)\) UQFF derivation; \(4\) T_hot_reactor\(ORB_ANALYSIS_20/26/30_PARAMS observed reactor base temperature\) = 366 K = D_BSFG \327 \(A_5+1\) = 6 \327 61 EXACT NEW composed form introducing A_5+1 successor structure \(analog to PAPER_1978 SO_5+1=11\) at Temperature-Kelvin reactor-base domain; \(5\) T_cold_reactor\(ORB_ANALYSIS_20/26/30_PARAMS observed reactor top temperature\) = 288 K = SO_5 \327 D_crit + magic_28 = 260 + 28 EXACT NEW additive form combining SO_5\267D_crit product with PAPER_1203 nuclear-shell-magic-number-28 \(magic_28 = D_crit + SO_5 - 2\267D_phys per CLAUDE.md\) at Temperature-Kelvin reactor-ambient domain \204 10TH CP2 ROUND MILESTONE marked) /Trapped /False
>>
